---
import Base from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<Base
  title={`Tanzania Family Safari | 6 Day Itinerary for Mothers & Children | Rendile Travels`}
  description={`A gentle 6 day Tanzania family safari, Tarangire's elephants, Lake Manyara and the Ngorongoro Crater, with short drives and welcoming lodges. Day by day itinerary and prices from $5,200.`}
  ogTitle={`Tanzania Family Safari | 6 Day Itinerary for Mothers & Children | Rendile Travels`}
  ogDescription={`A gentle northern Tanzania family safari, short drives, big wildlife. 6 days from $5,200.`}
  ogType={`website`}
  ogImage={`assets/img/tz-tarangire.jpg`}
  canonical={`https://rendiletravels.com/tanzania-family-safari.html`}
  jsonld={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TouristTrip","name":"Tanzania Family Safari — 6-Day Itinerary","description":"A gentle 6-day northern Tanzania family safari for mothers and children.","image":"https://rendiletravels.com/assets/img/tz-tarangire.jpg","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Rendile Travels"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"5200","priceCurrency":"USD"}}`}
  credit={`Imagery via Wikimedia Commons: Tarangire © Leyo; Ngorongoro © Eric Kilby; Lake Manyara © John Mackenzie Burke; Zanzibar © The Erica Chang. Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY</a> / <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY-SA</a>.`}
>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-tarangire.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Tanzania · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Tanzania Family Safari</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>6 days</b></span>
        <span>Tarangire · Manyara · Ngorongoro</span>
        <span>Mothers &amp; children</span>
        <span>from <b>$5,200</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Tanzania%20Family%20Safari" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="tanzania.html">Tanzania</a> / Tanzania Family Safari</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">A gentle northern loop made for families, short, easy drives, lots of elephants, and lodges with pools and room to roam. Wildlife by day; hot chocolate and starlit stories by night.</p>
        <p>Designed around children's energy and attention spans, with guides who are wonderful with little ones. Grandmothers, aunties and multigenerational groups are all warmly welcome.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 6 day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Arusha</h3><p>Met at Kilimanjaro Airport and taken to a family friendly lodge with a pool and gardens to stretch out after the flight.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Arusha country lodge · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Tarangire National Park</h3><p>A short drive to Tarangire, where huge elephant herds and giant baobabs make an instant, delightful introduction to safari.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Tarangire family lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Lake Manyara</h3><p>An easy day at Manyara, flamingo pink shallows, playful baboon troops and the famous tree climbing lions, with a relaxed picnic by the lake.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Karatu highlands lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Ngorongoro Crater</h3><p>Down into the crater for a half day of easy, big reward game viewing, lions, elephant and rhino, then back up for an afternoon by the fire.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Karatu highlands lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Maasai morning &amp; free time</h3><p>A friendly visit to a Maasai village, beadwork, songs and stories the children love, then a relaxed afternoon to swim and rest.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Karatu highlands lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Return &amp; farewell</h3><p>An easy drive back to Arusha or Kilimanjaro for your onward flight, full hearts and full memory cards.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Where you'll stay</p><h2 class="section__title">Family lodges</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Tanzania%20Family%20Safari"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-view.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Tarangire family lodge</h3><p>Pool, gardens and family rooms.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Tanzania%20Family%20Safari"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-suite.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Karatu highlands lodge</h3><p>A cosy base near the crater.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="contact.html?trip=Tanzania%20Family%20Safari"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/lodge-tent.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Connecting family tents</h3><p>Space for parents and children alike.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Private transfers throughout</li>
          <li>Family friendly lodges &amp; rooms</li>
          <li>Private 4x4 with pop up roof &amp; guide</li>
          <li>All game drives &amp; park fees</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Maasai village visit</li>
          <li>Child friendly pacing &amp; activities</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge &amp; all gratuities</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$5,200 per person sharing</strong>; child rates available. International flights and visas are extra. Suitable year round; June to October and January to February are easiest for families.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>A safari they'll never forget.</h2><p>Tell us your children's ages and we'll shape the perfect family pace.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Tanzania%20Family%20Safari" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More journeys</p><h2 class="section__title">Other Tanzania itineraries</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="classic-northern-circuit.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-ngorongoro.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Classic Northern Circuit</h3><p>8 days · Serengeti, Ngorongoro &amp; Tarangire.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="serengeti-and-zanzibar.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-zanzibar.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Serengeti &amp; Zanzibar</h3><p>10 days · safari &amp; beach.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="tanzania.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/tz-manyara.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All Tanzania itineraries</h3><p>Browse every Tanzania journey.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
